and to propose topics, though only elected Members may vote. The meeting wi=
ll again take place on Mattermost, and bridges are available from multiple =
other systems such as Telegram to make participation more convenient.=20

If you can, though, there are features of participation not available anywh=
ere except Mattermost such as receiving individual and group-wide notificat=
ions by email when you are flagged and correct use of graphics.=20

I will add this link in as many different lojban discussions as I can and a=
ppreciate if you would add it wherever I have not. I am happy to provide th=
e link below through email as well if you send me a note asking for it to c=
omcaresvcs@gmail.com. =20

